  "historyNote": "#2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84; ss by #4372, eff 2-24-88; ss by #4961, eff 10-26-90; EXPIRED 10-26-96 New. #6366, eff 10-30-96; amd by #7480, eff 4-24-01; amd by #13024, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-9-20, EXPIRED: 10-6-20; ss by #8263, eff 1-22-05; ss by #10360, eff 6-15-13; ss by #13853, eff 1-11-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 400)",
